	(text "Reference: supplied EasyEDA Pro project, schematic PDF and six-layer Gerber.\nMain PCB: 48 x 76 mm, R1.2 corners; provisional thickness 1.0 mm.\nAudio I2C pin assignment and crystal capacitor ground corrected.\nShell envelope target: <= 50 x 80 mm; display/battery stack still requires physical fit checks."
